// Runtime-completeness: native-map miss -> Witness Violates bridge (v2_interpreter.rs
// match_pattern). A missing composite key bottoms out at the native key-probe Null
// sentinel; the discriminating arm asserts it presents as Violates (not a non-exhaustive
// match-on-null crash), paired with the present-key Holds control. Carries the parse-path
// crash fixed in #4530; removing the bridge turns the miss arm red.
